<title>USA: MVSI Inc buys back two percent of stock.</title>
<headline>MVSI Inc buys back two percent of stock.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MVSI Inc said the company and members of the board of directors repurchased two percent, or 250,000 shares, of the outstanding common stock in open market and block transactions during the second quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to continue to buy back additional securities in open market or block purchases.</p>
<p>MVSI is a technology products and services company.</p>
</text>
